---
title: Vermont Football Officials
---

include _includes/mixins/topics.pug

h1.text-center Vermont Football Officials
p.lead.text-center Resources and information for high school football officials in Vermont.

h2.mt-4 Information
- var count = function(name) { return (collections.information || []).filter(function (item) { return (item.data.tags || []).indexOf(name) !== -1; }).length; }
p
  each topic in (topics || [])
    if count(topic.name)
      a.topic-link.badge.rounded-pill.text-bg-light.border.text-decoration-none.me-1(href='/tags/' + topic.slug + '/')= topic.name
- var byDate = function(a, b) { return new Date(b.date) - new Date(a.date); }
+articleList((collections.information || []).slice().sort(byDate), topics)

h2.mt-4 Quizzes
div.list-group
  - var byTitle = function(a, b) { return String(a.data.title).localeCompare(String(b.data.title)); }
  each item in (collections.quizzes || []).slice().sort(byTitle)
    a.list-group-item.list-group-item-action(href=item.url)
      .row
        .col
          | #{item.data.title}
        .col-auto.text-secondary.text-nowrap
          | #{item.data.questions} questions

p.mt-4
  | Interested in becoming an official? 
  a(href='/contact/') Get in touch.
